{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"109506","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/109506","key":"MC-187522","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"04/Jun/20 9:04 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p><b>What I expected to happen was...:</b></p>\n\n<p>The server should've generated an amplified world with&nbsp;<em>level-type=amplified</em> set.</p>\n\n<p><b>What actually happened was...:</b></p>\n\n<p>It generates a default world instead.</p>\n\n<p><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Use the latest pre-release server .jar. (which can be found <a href=\"https://launcher.mojang.com/v1/objects/ce66f98cabc1038ceba3b715b7dad5f70e27f88a/server.jar\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">here</a>)</li>\n\t<li>In server.properties, set&nbsp;<em>level-type</em> to&nbsp;<em>amplified</em>&nbsp;(server changes \"AMPLIFIED\" or \"Amplified\" to all lower-case on startup).</li>\n\t<li>Generate the world and behold a land strewn with defaultness.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p><b>Solutions I've tried:</b></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Setting server.properties to read-only to prevent the server from changing the level-type to lowercase.</li>\n\t<li>Generating the amplified world in singleplayer (which works, by the way) and copying the folder to the server (which doesn't work <img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/sad.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\">).</li>\n\t<li>Messing around with the level.dat file to force the generator setting to amplified.</li>\n\t<li>Copying an old 1.15.2 amplified server world.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>I'd like to note that none of the aforementioned solutions work.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"05/Jun/20 6:00 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/144566","id":"144566","filename":"20w20b-server.log","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png"},"displayName":"migrated","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"05/Jun/20 4:22 PM","size":"5 kB","mimeType":"text/plain","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/144566"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/144567","id":"144567","filename":"2f411e2bc7a217ac2c7568adc73d1e71-1.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl